**Are scrolls consumed?** No. Casting from the action bar never eats the scroll.

**Can other mods open the equip UI?** Yes. Addons can open a custom equip UI via `SpellActionbarMenuOpeners`. Cast gating helpers (`ActionbarCastGate`) exist for addons such as Specs.

**Why is Iron’s own spell bar gone?** Actionbar hides it on purpose so icons and mana do not double up.

**Does this work with Leylines?** Yes. Leyline spells are Iron’s school spells. Equip their scrolls (or unlock them through Codex) onto the same bar.
